  m_text: 'A Decal Projector projects a material along its box''s blue (Z) axis. Every surface inside the box receives it; the meshes do not change. This one points down at the floor: a rust stain.


    <b>Predict:</b> The figure stands inside the decal''s box. Will the stain appear on the figure too?


    <b>Try:</b> Select Decal - Rust stain and look at its box in the Scene view. Move the figure in and out of the box. Change the decal''s Width, Height and Projection Depth, and its Opacity.'
