  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The puddles are placed by a grey mask used as a height map: dark = low. Water fills every part of the mask below the Water Level: there the surface is darker, almost perfectly smooth and flat, with rain ripples. Shader: Surface/Wet-Puddles.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You raise the Water Level a little. Where does new water appear first?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Move Water Level and Rain Ripples (M_Surf_Puddles). Then, in Environment \u203A Volume - Neutral + SSR, turn the Screen Space Reflection override off and on: what changes in the puddles?"
