  m_text: 'A poster or a sign can be a decal: no new mesh, it follows the wall. This one (URP''s decal shader) changes only the Base Color; its Normal Blend is 0. A spot light grazes the wall from the side.


    <b>Predict:</b> Will the board marks of the concrete show through the poster?


    <b>Try:</b> Select the poster''s material (M_Decal_Poster) and raise Normal Blend from 0 to 1. Move the side light. Then try the leak or the rust stain material on this projector.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
