--- !u!114 &4190798230647968296
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8960606342741860503}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Decals add wear where it happens: a leak below a window sill, dirt at the base of a wall. Each is a Decal Projector pointing into the wall, with a material made from URP's own decal shader (Shader Graphs/Decal).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> The box of the dirt decal also reaches into the floor in front of the wall. What will the floor inside the box look like?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Select Decal - Dirt at the base and look at its box. Change its Pivot and Height until the box stops at the floor. Make a decal of your own: GameObject \u203A Rendering \u203A URP Decal Projector, then Material \u203A New \u203A URP Decal."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6055507529455485361, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
