  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "An Occlusion Map darkens the crevices: the joints between the stones, where dirt also collects. A has the stones' Occlusion Map; B is the same material without it. The roof shades the top of both walls.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Where do A and B differ more: in the shade under the roof, or in the sunlit part below it?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Select A's material (M_Surf_Occlusion-On) and move the Occlusion Map's strength between 0 and 1. Watch the shaded part and the sunlit part.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Textures training, 3 \xB7 Texture maps</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
