  m_text: 'A decal does not have to change the colour. This puddle decal changes only the smoothness of the asphalt under it: Color Opacity 0, Normal Blend 0, Smoothness 0.95 (shader Surface/Decal-Masked, shaped by a mask).


    <b>Predict:</b> You look at the puddle from a low camera, near the ground, and from a high one, looking down at it under the lamp. From where do you see it, and what do you see in it?


    <b>Try:</b> Look through both cameras of this station (low and high), or orbit the Scene view down to the ground. Then raise the decal material''s Normal Blend and Color Opacity (M_Decal_Puddle-Smoothness).


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Material chart: wet asphalt</color></size>'
