  m_text: 'Rising damp: the bottom of the wall is darker and a little smoother, up to a ragged line with a pale edge of salt. Shader Surface/Damp-Base measures the height of each pixel in the world, from Ground Height.


    <b>Predict:</b> You move the wall 1 m up (Position Y = 1). Does the damp move up with the wall?


    <b>Try:</b> Move the wall up and down. Change Damp Height and Edge Raggedness (M_Surf_Damp-Plaster). Compare with station 1, where the grime is placed by the UVs.'
