  m_text: 'The Detail Inputs'' Base Map is a grey picture laid over the surface''s colour: soot, dust, stains. The three panels use the same concrete and three different grey detail maps, without a mask.


    <b>Predict:</b> C''s detail map is plain mid-grey (128). What does it change on C? And what do A''s darker and B''s lighter detail maps do?


    <b>Try:</b> Drag another detail map (T_Detail_Soot, T_Detail_Dust, T_Detail_Neutral-Grey in Assets/Library/Textures/Surface) onto a panel''s detail Base Map. Move the Scale next to it from 1 to 0, then to 2.'
